st payment to live in her living establishment upfront, he heads to the local middle school to get hired as a teacher. However, the principal refuses to hire him without hesitation. She will not hire men as teachers and makes it clear that she hates all men, saying they put no love into their passions and work. Amawa does not give up and with the help of his landlady, he crossdresses as a woman without a second thought, and gets hired, so he can earn money and also prove the principal wrong. Now, he has to keep his real gender a secret, and avoid strange situations, including the affections of his students (from both genders).\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Bisexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Teacher","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Femboy","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acrobatics","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":36,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"I My Me! Strawberry Eggs","english":null,"native":"あぃまぃみぃ！ストロベリー・エッグ","romaji":"I My Me! Strawberry Eggs","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"あぃまぃみぃ! ストロベリー・エッグ"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"青春草莓蛋"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"I My Me草莓蛋"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"I My Me! Strawberry Egg"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}